abstract: >-
  ETIS Engineering Studio is an engineering apprenticeship environment for
  evidence-based software engineering reviews in which students remain the
  responsible engineers while bounded AI reviewers challenge and coach their
  reasoning.
keywords:
  - software engineering education
  - engineering judgment
  - artificial intelligence
  - engineering review
  - evidence-based learning
